🎙️ 1. THE GLOBAL NEWS ANCHOR
(Male or Female — CNN/ABC/Reuters/NPR/PBS documentary tone)
Tone: Neutral, authoritative, warm
 Energy: Calm, steady, trustworthy
 Vibe: “This is the world as it is — and as it’s becoming.”
 Speed:
Slow: solemn, reflective
Medium: standard broadcast cadence
Fast: breaking‑news urgency
 Emotion: Controlled empathy, intellectual clarity
Voice Description:
 This narrator sounds like the voice of global journalism — balanced, factual, emotionally grounded.
 Perfect diction.
 Zero sensationalism.
 Every sentence feels like it belongs in a documentary or a primetime news special.
Sample Line:
 “Artificial intelligence is no longer a distant concept. It is here, shaping our lives, our relationships, and our future — one quiet interaction at a time.”
Best For:
Main episodes
Explanations of complex topics
Emotional but factual storytelling
Long‑form narration
Educational content

